    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48717" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρ-ᾱτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,= <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρεντικός, σκύλακες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.628
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. σημεῖα</span> signals <i>given
				by the hunter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.593b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. φόρος</span> tax <i>for
				game-licence</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				3.222
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fit for winning</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ θ. τῶν φίλων</span>
			<i>the arts for winning</i> friends, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>fond of hunting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.0a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				965b
			</span></i>.</div>
